<Layout title="Privacy — JevTrends"><article class="container prose listing-page"><h1>Privacy</h1><p>JevTrends uses Umami Cloud for aggregate traffic measurement on its production domain. Tracking may be blocked by your browser; the directory still works.</p><p>The site saves your light or dark theme preference in your browser’s local storage. Search and filters run in your browser; query text is excluded from our Umami pageview URL.</p><p>X posts load only when you select “Load original X post.” That connects your browser to X, whose own privacy practices apply. Ordinary source links also take you to external websites.</p><p>Hosting and analytics providers process requests under their own policies. Read <a href="https://umami.is/privacy">Umami’s privacy policy</a> and <a href="https://x.com/en/privacy">X’s privacy policy</a>. Contact <a href="https://x.com/FKNMADEIT">@FKNMADEIT</a> with questions about this directory.</p></article></Layout>
